    "contentMarkdown": "<div id=\"response-root\" style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fdfbf7 0%, #f3f8f2 100%); color: #2d3748; padding: 24px; border-radius: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n<style>\n  @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n  .card { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out forwards; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }\n  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n</style>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2b6cb0, #38a169); -webkit-background-clip: text; color: transparent; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Past Simple · 一般过去时</div>\n  <div style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 15px;\">从课本出发，让过去有迹可循</div>\n  <img src=\"/表情包/知识点来了.jpg\" width=\"100\" style=\"margin-top: 12px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left: 5px solid #48bb78;\">\n  <div class=\"badge\" style=\"background: #c6f6d5; color: #22543d;\">课本原点 · Read and Think</div>\n  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0;\">你的课本从两段对话带我们“发现”一般过去时：</p>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #f0fff4; padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #276749;\">Conversation A</strong>\n      <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px;\">How did you <u>celebrate</u>? → We <u>celebrated</u>...<br><span style=\"color: #38a169;\">✅ 描述过去发生的动作</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #f0fff4; padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #276749;\">Conversation B</strong>\n      <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px;\">I <u>like</u> them very much. (现在)<br>I <u>didn't like</u> them. (过去)<br><span style=\"color: #38a169;\">✅ 对比现在与过去的状态</span></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #4a5568;\"><strong>Work out the rules：</strong>一般过去时用来谈论 <span style=\"background: #c6f6d5; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px;\">过去发生的动作</span> 以及 <span style=\"background: #c6f6d5; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px;\">过去的习惯与状态</span>。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left: 5px solid #4299e1;\">\n  <div class=\"badge\" style=\"background: #bee3f8; color: #2a4365;\">核心拓展 · 动词变形 & 句型</div>\n  \n  <h3 style=\"margin: 16px 0 8px; font-size: 17px; color: #2b6cb0;\">📘 课本练习中的动词变形</h3>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #ebf8ff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #718096;\">原形</div><div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">watch</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #2b6cb0;\">→ watched</div></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #ebf8ff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #718096;\">原形</div><div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">celebrate</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #2b6cb0;\">→ celebrated</div></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #ebf8ff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #718096;\">原形</div><div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">play</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #2b6cb0;\">→ played</div></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #fff5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #718096;\">原形</div><div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">be</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c53030;\">→ was / were</div></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #fff5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #718096;\">原形</div><div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">eat</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c53030;\">→ ate</div></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #fff5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #718096;\">原形</div><div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">learn</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c53030;\">→ learned / learnt</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin: 16px 0 8px; font-size: 17px; color: #2b6cb0;\">🔧 规则动词变化细则</h3>\n  <div style=\"background: #f7fafc; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span><strong>一般情况下 + ed</strong></span><span>play → play<strong>ed</strong></span></div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span><strong>以 e 结尾 + d</strong></span><span>celebrate → celebrate<strong>d</strong></span></div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span><strong>辅音 + y 结尾，变 y 为 i + ed</strong></span><span>study → stud<strong>ied</strong></span></div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span><strong>重读闭音节，双写尾字母 + ed</strong></span><span>stop → sto<strong>pped</strong></span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin: 16px 0 8px; font-size: 17px; color: #2b6cb0;\">⏳ 句型公式（实义动词）</h3>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #e6fffa; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #234e52; margin-bottom: 4px;\">肯定句</div>主语 + 动词过去式<br><span style=\"color: #718096;\">I ate zongzi.</span></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #fffaf0; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #744210; margin-bottom: 4px;\">否定句</div>主语 + <strong>didn't</strong> + 动词原形<br><span style=\"color: #718096;\">I didn't eat zongzi.</span></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #faf5ff; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #553c9a; margin-bottom: 4px;\">疑问句</div><strong>Did</strong> + 主语 + 动词原形?<br><span style=\"color: #718096;\">Did you eat zongzi?</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #c53030; background: #fff5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px;\">⚠️ 易错点：否定句和疑问句中，动词必须<strong>还原为原形</strong>！不要说 *didn't ate* 或 *Did you went*。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left: 5px solid #ed8936;\">\n  <div class=\"badge\" style=\"background: #feebc8; color: #744210;\">时间线索 · 标志词</div>\n  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 14px; font-size: 14px;\">看到这些“信号灯”，就要警觉：句子很可能要用一般过去时。</p>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 22px;\">\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 6px; bottom: 6px; width: 3px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ed8936, #f6ad55); border-radius: 3px;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #c05621;\">yesterday</span> — yesterday morning / afternoon / evening</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #c05621;\">last + 时间</span> — last week / month / year / Sunday / Dragon Boat Festival</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #c05621;\">... ago</span> — two days ago / three years ago / a moment ago</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #c05621;\">just now</span> — 刚才</div>\n    <div style=\"padding-left: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #c05621;\">in + 过去年份 / at that time</span> — in 2023 / at that time</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left: 5px solid #9f7aea;\">\n  <div class=\"badge\" style=\"background: #e9d8fd; color: #44337a;\">考场直击 · 四类常考题型</div>\n  \n  <div style=\"margin-top: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #553c9a; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 15px;\">题型一：动词变形填空</div>\n    <div style=\"background: #faf5ff; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n      用所给动词的适当形式填空（课本同款）。<br>\n      1. We _______ (celebrate) the Dragon Boat Festival last weekend.<br>\n      2. She _______ (watch) a dragon boat race with her parents.<br>\n      3. My grandma _______ (be) very happy because we _______ (eat) zongzi together.<br>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 10px; color: #718096; font-size: 13px;\">答案：1. celebrated &nbsp; 2. watched &nbsp; 3. was; ate</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #553c9a; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 15px;\">题型二：句型转换</div>\n    <div style=\"background: #faf5ff; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n      对划线部分提问 / 改为否定句和一般疑问句。<br>\n      例：They <u>played games</u> after dinner. (对划线提问)<br>\n      → <strong>What did they do after dinner?</strong><br><br>\n      例：He learned to make zongzi. (否定句)<br>\n      → <strong>He didn't learn to make zongzi.</strong>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #553c9a; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 15px;\">题型三：对话补全（语境判断）</div>\n    <div style=\"background: #faf5ff; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n      根据上下文，从方框中选择恰当的词并用正确形式填空。<br>\n      方框：watch, be, celebrate, play, learn, eat<br>\n      — How was your last Spring Festival?<br>\n      — It _______ great! We _______ dumplings and _______ firecrackers.<br>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 10px; color: #718096; font-size: 13px;\">答案：was; ate; played</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #553c9a; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 15px;\">题型四：不规则动词辨音/拼写</div>\n    <div style=\"background: #faf5ff; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px;\">\n      选出下列动词过去式拼写或发音正确的一项：<br>\n      A. eat → eated &nbsp; B. see → saw &nbsp; C. go → goed &nbsp; D. buy → buyed<br>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 10px; color: #718096; font-size: 13px;\">答案：B (see → saw)</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 28px 0 12px; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;\">掌握了这些，课本里的端午节对话和考试题型就都能拿下啦！<br>你想先从哪一块再深入练一练？</p>\n  <button onclick=\"input('我想练习不规则动词')\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38a169, #2f855a); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; margin: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(56,161,105,0.3); transition: transform 0.2s;\">🎯 不规则动词速记</button>\n  <button onclick=\"input('给我更多句型转换练习题')\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4299e1, #2b6cb0); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; margin: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(66,153,225,0.3); transition: transform 0.2s;\">🔄 句型转换专练</button>\n  <button onclick=\"input('我想做一套综合测试题')\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ed8936, #dd6b20); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; margin: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(237,137,54,0.3); transition: transform 0.2s;\">📝 来套综合测试</button>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #cbd5e0, transparent); margin: 20px 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #a0aec0; text-align: center;\">\n  基于你的课本 <em>Grammar in use: Past simple</em> 展开 · UniStudy 学习终端\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<<<[TOOL_REQUEST]>>>\nsubject:「始」[演示案例 - 英语]演示案例 - 英语「末」,\ntool_name:「始」DailyNote「末」,\ncommand:「始」create「末」,\nDate:「始」2026-05-10「末」,\nContent:「始」[18:32] 基于课本（端午节与春节主题对话）开展 Past Simple 教学互动。从 Conversation A/B 的 celebrate/celebrated 与 like/didn't like 语境对比出发，明确一般过去时用于\"过去发生的动作\"及\"过去的状态/习惯\"。系统梳理规则动词四种变形规则（+ed, +d, 变y为i+ed, 双写尾字母+ed）与课本不规则动词（be→was/were, eat→ate, learn→learned/learnt, watch/celebrate/play→+ed）。整理句型结构：肯定句用过去式，否定句用 didn't + 原形，疑问句用 Did + 主语 + 原形，并强调时间标志词（last week, ago, yesterday, just now）。针对考试设计四类常考题型：动词变形填空、句型转换（否定/疑问/划线提问）、节日主题对话补全、不规则动词辨音/拼写。特别提示易错点：否定疑问句中动词必须还原原形，be动词与实义动词助动词不可混用。「末」\n<<<[END_TOOL_REQUEST]>>>\n\n<div id=\"response-root\" style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2d3748; padding: 16px 24px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    <img src=\"/表情包/收到.jpg\" width=\"64\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px;\">笔记已归档</div>\n      <div style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 13px;\">刚才关于 Past Simple 的梳理已经存进你的学习日记里啦。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ebf8ff, #f0fff4); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(66,153,225,0.15); margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #2b6cb0; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 15px;\">💡 再给你一个小诀窍：Be 动词 vs. 实义动词</div>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4a5568;\">\n      考试中很多同学会写出这样的错误句子：<span style=\"color: #c53030; text-decoration: line-through;\">I didn't was happy.</span><br>\n      记住口诀：<strong>“有 be 用 be，无 be 请 did”</strong>。<br>\n      be 动词的过去式是 <span style=\"background: #c6f6d5; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">was/were</span>，它有自己的否定形式 <span style=\"background: #c6f6d5; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">wasn't / weren't</span>，不需要再请 <strong>did</strong> 来帮忙！\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    现在你对一般过去时的框架应该比较清晰了。接下来你想怎么巩固？\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;\">\n    <button onclick=\"input('帮我出一道结合春节或端午节语境的完形填空')\" style=\"background: #fff; border: 2px solid #48bb78; color: #276749; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;\">🏮 节日语境完形填空</button>\n    <button onclick=\"input('帮我总结一下常见的不规则动词表')\" style=\"background: #fff; border: 2px solid #4299e1; color: #2b6cb0; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;\">📋 不规则动词表</button>\n    <button onclick=\"input('一般过去时和现在完成时有什么区别')\" style=\"background: #fff; border: 2px solid #ed8936; color: #c05621; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;\">⚡ 易混时态对比</button>\n  </div>\n</div>",
